# WindUI Shiny / WindUI Boreal — Complete Documentation for Developers and AI Agents

> WindUI Shiny is a refined fork of the original WindUI Roblox UI library. It preserves the original API style while adding visual refinements, fixes, and extra elements such as `MultiSection`, `ButtonKeybind`, `ToggleKeybind`, `Video`, `Watermark`, background video, sidebar controls, advanced notifications, and several source-observed elements like `Stepper`, `Segmented`, `Progress`, and `Stats`.

