## Global API

Methods and properties available on the main `WindUI` object.

| API | Description |
|---|---|
| `WindUI:CreateWindow(config)` | Creates the single main window. Shiny supports one window per loaded library instance. |
| `WindUI:Notify(config)` | Creates a notification; returns a notification object. Supports buttons. |
| `WindUI:Popup(config)` | Creates a standalone popup. |
| `WindUI:AddTheme(theme)` | Adds a custom theme table. |
| `WindUI:SetTheme(name)` | Applies an existing theme by name. Returns the theme table or `nil`. |
| `WindUI:GetThemes()` | Returns the themes table. |
| `WindUI:GetCurrentTheme()` | Returns current theme name. |
| `WindUI:Gradient(colors, config)` | Creates a gradient table with `Color` and `Transparency` sequences. |
| `WindUI:SetFont(fontId)` | Sets the global UI font. |
| `WindUI:SetParent(parent)` | Moves WindUI ScreenGuis to a different parent. |
| `WindUI:SetNotificationLower(bool)` | Moves notifications lower, useful on mobile. |
| `WindUI:GetTransparency()` | Returns current transparent state. |
| `WindUI:GetWindowSize()` | Returns current window size if a window exists. |
| `WindUI:Localization(config)` | Enables/configures localization. |
| `WindUI:SetLanguage(code)` | Sets localization language. |
| `WindUI:ToggleAcrylic(enabled)` | Enables/disables acrylic model effect if configured. |
| `WindUI:OnThemeChange(callback)` | Registers a callback fired when theme changes. |
| `WindUI.Services` | Key-system service registry. Includes `platoboost`, `pandadevelopment`, `luarmor`, and source-observed `junkiedevelopment`. |
| `WindUI.Creator` | Internal creator module. Advanced usage only. |
| `WindUI.Version` | Version string. The provided Boreal build reports `0.0.0` internally and header `v0.0.2`. |

### Global Setup Examples

```lua
WindUI:SetNotificationLower(true)
WindUI:SetFont("rbxassetid://12187365364")
WindUI:OnThemeChange(function(themeName)
    print("Theme changed:", themeName)
end)
```

