## Window

Create the main window with `WindUI:CreateWindow(config)`.

```lua
local Window = WindUI:CreateWindow({
    Title = "My Hub",
    Icon = "door-open",
    Author = "by .ftgs",
    Folder = "MyHub",
    Size = UDim2.fromOffset(580, 460),
    MinSize = Vector2.new(560, 350),
    MaxSize = Vector2.new(850, 560),
    ToggleKey = Enum.KeyCode.LeftShift,
    Transparent = true,
    Theme = "Dark",
    Resizable = true,
    SideBarWidth = 200,
    BackgroundImageTransparency = 0.42,
    HideSearchBar = true,
    ScrollBarEnabled = false,
})
```

### Window Config

| Key | Type | Default / Notes |
|---|---|---|
| `Title` | `string` | Window title. Default `"UI Library"`. |
| `Author` | `string?` | Subtitle/author shown in topbar. |
| `Icon` | `string?` | Icon name, prefixed icon, `rbxassetid://`, or URL. |
| `IconSize` | `number?` | Default `22`. |
| `IconThemed` | `boolean?` | Theme-color icon. |
| `IconRadius` | `number?` | Rounded icon corner radius. |
| `Folder` | `string?` | Creates folders for configs/assets/keys. Required for config manager. |
| `Parent` | `Instance?` | Parent for window. Normally set by WindUI internals. |
| `Size` | `UDim2?` | Default around `580x460`; clamped to min/max. |
| `MinSize` | `Vector2?` | Default `Vector2.new(560, 350)`. |
| `MaxSize` | `Vector2?` | Default `Vector2.new(850, 560)`. |
| `Position` | `UDim2?` | Defaults center. |
| `Resizable` | `boolean?` | Default `true`. |
| `ToggleKey` | `Enum.KeyCode?` | Key to toggle open/closed. |
| `Transparent` | `boolean?` | Transparent/acrylic-like window background state. |
| `Theme` | `string?` | Theme name. Default `Dark`. |
| `SideBarWidth` | `number?` | Default `200`. |
| `HideSearchBar` | `boolean?` | Docs show `true` hides search; source default means search is visible unless explicitly hidden. |
| `ScrollBarEnabled` | `boolean?` | Adds custom scrollbar to sidebar/tab content. |
| `Background` | `string/table?` | Image source, gradient table, or `"video:<source>"`. |
| `BackgroundVideo` | `string/number?` | Video source for background. |
| `BackgroundImageTransparency` | `number?` | Default `0`. |
| `ShadowTransparency` | `number?` | Default `0.7`. |
| `Radius` | `number?` | Window radius. Default `16`. |
| `ElementsRadius` | `number?` | Element radius override. Modern default `23`, normal default `12`. |
| `TopBarButtonIconSize` | `number?` | Topbar icon size. Mac mode default `11`; default mode `16`. |
| `Acrylic` | `boolean?` | Enables acrylic/blur effect. |
| `ModernLayout` | `boolean?` | Enables Shiny modern compact/glass layout. |
| `ModernLayoutMergeElements` | `boolean?` | Whether modern layout merges element shapes. Alias: `ModernLayoutMerge`. Default true. |
| `IgnoreAlerts` | `boolean?` | If true, skips close confirmation. |
| `HidePanelBackground` | `boolean?` | Hides main panel background. |
| `AutoScale` | `boolean?` | Auto-scales window to viewport. Default true. |
| `OpenButton` | `table/false?` | Floating/mobile open button. Set `false` to disable. |
| `BottomDragBarEnabled` | `boolean?` | Bottom drag handle. Default true. |
| `BottomDragEnabled` | `boolean?` | Alias for bottom drag handle. |
| `Watermark` | `table/false?` | Creates background watermark. |
| `User` | `table?` | Sidebar user block config. |
| `Footer` | `table?` | Reserved/compatibility footer config. |
| `Topbar` | `table?` | `{ Height = 52, ButtonsType = "Default" or "Mac" }`. |
| `KeySystem` | `table?` | Access-control key system. |

### Important Window Notes

- WindUI Shiny allows only one window per loaded library instance. Creating a second window warns and returns nothing.
- If `Folder` is set and file APIs exist, Shiny creates `WindUI/<Folder>/assets`, `<Folder>/assets`, and config paths.
- `OpenButton = false` disables the open button behavior according to FAQ.

