### ModernLayout

`ModernLayout` is a creation-time style mode.

```lua
local Window = WindUI:CreateWindow({
    Title = "Modern Window",
    Folder = "WindUI-Modern",
    ModernLayout = true,
    ElementsRadius = 24,
})
```

Effects:

1. Tighter default element padding (`10` instead of `13`).
2. Larger default element radius (`23` instead of `12`).
3. Compact tab spacing (`1` instead of `6`) when merged.
4. Glass-style outlines for tabs, sections, multi sections, and video.
5. Shape recalculation for grouped/adjacent elements.

There is no dedicated runtime `SetModernLayout`; choose it when creating the window.

### BottomDragBarEnabled

Controls the bottom drag handle.

```lua
local Window = WindUI:CreateWindow({
    Title = "Bottom Drag Demo",
    BottomDragBarEnabled = true,
})

Window:SetBottomDragBarEnabled(false)
task.wait(0.5)
Window:SetBottomDragBarEnabled(true)
```

Aliases:

```lua
BottomDragBarEnabled = true
BottomDragEnabled = true
```

Internally enabled when neither config is explicitly `false`.

### Background Video

```lua
local Window = WindUI:CreateWindow({
    Title = "Background Media",
    Folder = "WindUI-BG",
    BackgroundVideo = "1234567890",
})
```

Accepted formats:

1. `number` — converted to `rbxassetid://...`
2. numeric string — `"1234567890"`
3. `rbxassetid://...`
4. `"video:<source>"`
5. URL — requires executor file APIs for best reliability

Runtime:

```lua
Window:SetBackgroundVideo("1234567890")
Window:SetBackgroundVideo("video:rbxassetid://1234567890")
Window:SetBackgroundImage("rbxassetid://987654321")
Window:SetBackgroundImageTransparency(0.35)
Window:SetBackgroundTransparency(0.2)
```

### Watermark

Watermark adds a floating text label over the window background.

```lua
local Window = WindUI:CreateWindow({
    Title = "Watermark Demo",
    Watermark = {
        Enabled = true,
        Text = " | v1.0.0",
        Opacity = 0.45,
        Position = "bottom-right",
        Size = 14,
        Padding = 12,
        Offset = Vector2.new(0, 0),
    },
})
```

You can also create/replace it at runtime:

```lua
local WM = Window:Watermark({
    Text = "Shiny | Build 240",
    Position = "top-right",
    Opacity = 0.55,
    Size = 15,
    Padding = 14,
    Offset = Vector2.new(-4, 2),
    RichText = true,
})
```

Watermark config:

| Key | Type | Default / Notes |
|---|---|---|
| `Enabled` | `boolean` | Default true. |
| `Text` | `string` | Default `"Watermark"`. |
| `Opacity` | `number` | Clamped `0` to `1`; default `0.45`. |
| `Position` | `string/UDim2` | Preset or custom position. |
| `Size` | `number` | Minimum `8`; default `14`. |
| `Padding` | `number` | Preset position padding. |
| `Offset` | `Vector2` | Offset from preset. |
| `Color` | `Color3?` | Optional explicit color. |
| `RichText` | `boolean` | Rich text tags. |
| `AnchorPoint` | `Vector2?` | Used when `Position` is `UDim2`. |

Preset positions:

```text
top-left, top-center, top-right
center-left, center, center-right
bottom-left, bottom-center, bottom-right
```

Watermark methods:

```lua
WM:SetEnabled(true)
WM:SetText("New text")
WM:SetOpacity(0.7)
WM:SetPosition("bottom-left")
WM:SetPosition(UDim2.new(0.5, 0, 0, 24))
WM:SetOffset(Vector2.new(0, 0))
WM:SetPadding(12)
WM:SetSize(14)
WM:Destroy()
```

