    Icon = "bird",
    IconColor = Color3.fromRGB(100, 150, 255),
    IconShape = "Square", -- or "Circle"
    IconThemed = true,
    Locked = false,
    ShowTabTitle = false,
    Border = true,
    LayoutOrder = 1,
})

Tab:Select()
```

### Tab Methods

```lua
Tab:Select()
Tab:ScrollToTheElement(1)
Tab:LockAll()
Tab:UnlockAll()
local locked = Tab:GetLocked()
local unlocked = Tab:GetUnlocked()
```

The base element wrapper injects common setters into many elements, not tabs. For tab title/description mutation, original WindUI had `SetTitle`/`SetDesc`; Shiny source shown mainly documents selection/lock helpers.

