## Sidebar Tab Sections

`Window:Section()` creates collapsible groups in the left sidebar for tabs and sidebar controls.

```lua
local Section = Window:Section({
    Title = "Section for tabs",
    Icon = "bird",
    IconThemed = true,
    Opened = true,
})

local Tab1 = Section:Tab({ Title = "Tab 1" })
local Tab2 = Section:Tab({ Title = "Tab 2" })
```

States:

- Just text if no child items are created.
- Expand/collapse once child tabs/elements exist.

Sidebar section also supports sidebar label/button/space/divider helpers in source:

```lua
