## Notifications / Notify with Buttons

`WindUI:Notify(config)` creates a notification and returns a notification object.

### Basic Notification

```lua
WindUI:Notify({
    Title = "Notification Title",
    Content = "Content!",
    Duration = 3,
    Icon = "bird",
})
```

### Notification with Buttons

```lua
local n = WindUI:Notify({
    Title = "Configuration Loaded",
    Content = "Choose an action below.",
    Icon = "bell",
    IconThemed = true,
    Background = "rbxassetid://0",
    BackgroundImageTransparency = 0.75,
    Duration = 12,
    CanClose = true,
    Buttons = {
        {
            Title = "Apply",
            Icon = "check",
            Variant = "Primary",
            CloseOnClick = false,
            Callback = function(notification, button, index)
                print("Apply clicked")
            end,
        },
        {
            Title = "Dismiss",
            Icon = "x",
            Variant = "Secondary",
            CloseOnClick = true,
            Callback = function()
                print("Dismiss clicked")
            end,
        },
    },
})

task.delay(10, function()
    if n and not n.Closed then
        n:Close()
    end
end)
```

### Notify Config

| Key | Type | Default / Notes |
|---|---|---|
| `Title` | `string` | `"Notification"` |
| `Content` | `string?` | Body text. |
| `Icon` | `string?` | Optional icon. |
| `IconThemed` | `boolean?` | Themed icon coloring. |
| `Background` | `string?` | Background image source. |
| `BackgroundImageTransparency` | `number?` | Default `0`. |
| `Duration` | `number` | Docs default `5`; older simple docs say `3`. Source default is `5`. |
| `CanClose` | `boolean` | Default true. |
| `Buttons` | `table[]` | Action buttons. |
| `ButtonLayout` / `ButtonsLayout` | `string?` | `Auto`, `Horizontal`, or `Vertical` observed. |
| `ButtonAlignment` / `ButtonsAlignment` | `string?` | `Left`, `Center`, `Right`. |
| `ButtonHeight` | `number?` | Default `40`, min `28`. |
| `ButtonPadding` | `number?` | Default `6`. |
| `ButtonDebounce` | `boolean?` | Default true. |
| `ButtonCooldown` | `number?` | Default `0.12`. |

### Notification Button Config

| Key | Type | Default / Notes |
|---|---|---|
| `Title` / `Text` | `string` | Required/recommended. |
| `Icon` | `string?` | Optional icon. |
| `Variant` | `string?` | Button style. |
| `Callback` | `function?` | Called on click. Source passes `(notification, buttonObject, index)`. |
| `CloseOnClick` | `boolean` | Default true. |
| `CloseDelay` | `number?` | Delay before close. |
| `CloseBeforeCallback` | `boolean?` | Close before callback if true. |
| `Debounce` | `boolean?` | Defaults to notification debounce. |
| `Cooldown` | `number?` | Button cooldown. |
| `Disabled` | `boolean?` | Starts disabled. |
| `Width` | `number?` | Fixed button width. |
| `Height` | `number?` | Fixed button height. |
| `Visible` | `boolean?` | Default true. |
| `LayoutOrder` | `number?` | Sort order. |
| `RunAsync` / `Async` | `boolean?` | Async callback flow. |

### Notification Methods

```lua
n:Close()
```

