### Locked MultiSection Notes

```lua
local LockedMulti = MainTab:MultiSection({
    Title = "Protected Profiles",
    Desc = "Requires unlock",
    Locked = true,
    LockedTitle = "Unlock first",
    Box = true,
    Opened = true,
})
```

Locking:

1. Disables header interaction.
2. Prevents tab click switching.
3. Locks lockable child elements in all tabs.
4. Programmatic `SelectTab(...)` still works even when locked.

