        print("Stepper:", value)
    end,
})
```

Config:

| Key | Type | Default |
|---|---|---|
| `Title` | `string` | `"Stepper"` |
| `Desc` | `string?` | nil |
| `Locked` | `boolean` | false |
| `LockedTitle` | `string?` | nil |
| `Value` | `table/number` | `{ Min = 0, Max = 100, Default = 0 }` or number. |
| `Step` | `number` | `1` |
| `Precision` | `number?` | Auto `2` for decimal step; otherwise `0`. |
| `Prefix` | `string` | empty |
