| `HoldDelay` | `number` | `0.28` |
| `HoldRate` | `number` | `0.07` |
| `Width` | `number` | min `168`, default `182` |
| `ButtonSize` | `number` | min `28`, default `34` |
| `Flag` | `string?` | Config saving. |
