## Legacy Group Compatibility

The source contains a `Group` layout container for horizontal layouts:

```lua
local Group = Tab:Group({})
Group:Button({ Title = "A" })
Group:Button({ Title = "B" })
```

In original WindUI, `Group` was deprecated in favor of newer stack layouts. WindUI Shiny source keeps `Group` for compatibility. Since Shiny docs do not document `HStack`/`VStack`, agents should:

- Use `Section`, `MultiSection`, and normal vertical layouts by default.
- Use `Group` only if the user explicitly asks for horizontal side-by-side layout or compatibility with old examples.
- Do not overuse `Group`; it can complicate sizing and future compatibility.

