Window-level shortcuts are source-observed and independent of element keybinds.

```lua
local shortcutId = Window:BindShortcut("K", function(input, window, shortcut)
    print("Shortcut pressed")
end, {
    Ctrl = true,
    Shift = false,
    Alt = nil, -- nil means ignored
    EnabledWhenClosed = false,
