## Troubleshooting

### Shiny Loader Fails

Check:

- HTTP/loadstring support exists in the environment.
- The raw GitHub URL is reachable.
- The fork branch/path is still valid:

```text
https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jonathabejose-alt/Wind-UI-Boreal/refs/heads/main/WindUI%20Boreal
```

### Configs Do Not Save

Check:

- `Folder` is set on `CreateWindow`.
- Executor supports file APIs.
- Each element has a unique `Flag`.
- You call `cfg:Save()`.
- Shiny/Boreal uses `WindUI/<Folder>/config/` in the observed source.

### Key System Gets Stuck

Check:

- `KeyValidator` returns a boolean.
- Service API args match the service’s `Args` list.
- `SaveKey` path is writable.
- Third-party service endpoints are reachable.

### Dropdown Returns Table Instead of String

If `Values` are rich tables, callbacks may receive the original selected table. In multi-select, callbacks receive an array.

```lua
Callback = function(value)
    if typeof(value) == "table" then
        print(value.Title or value.Value or value[1])
    else
        print(value)
    end
end
```

### Background Video Does Not Play

- Roblox `VideoFrame` has asset restrictions.
- Numeric IDs are converted to `rbxassetid://...`.
- Remote video URLs require executor file APIs and may still not work in `VideoFrame`.

### Search Bar Hidden or Visible Unexpectedly

Docs and source defaults differ slightly. If you want to hide search, explicitly set:

```lua
HideSearchBar = true
```

If you want it visible, explicitly set:

```lua
HideSearchBar = false
```

### Group Layout Issues

`Group` is compatibility-only. Prefer vertical layout, sections, or MultiSection unless horizontal layout is required.

